der.webapplicationbuilder) configures a middleware pipeline that wraps middleware added in `Program.cs` with `UseRouting` and `UseEndpoints`. However, apps can change the order in which `UseRouting` and `UseEndpoints` run by calling these methods explicitly. For example, the following code makes an explicit call to `UseRouting`:

```
app.Use(async (context, next) =>
{
